    "value_statement": "Product teams need clear methods to prioritize ideas, synthesize research, and document requirements. This skill provides RICE scoring, interview analysis guidance, PRD templates, and product discovery workflows.",
    "seo_keywords": [
      "Claude product management skill",
      "Codex product manager toolkit",
      "Claude Code PRD templates",
      "RICE prioritization",
