      "product discovery framework",
      "go-to-market planning",
      "PRD template",
      "roadmap planning"
    ],
    "actual_capabilities": [
      "Calculate RICE scores from local CSV inputs using reach, impact, confidence, and effort fields.",
      "Rank features and summarize quick wins, big bets, effort distribution, and suggested quarterly roadmap capacity.",
      "Analyze local interview transcripts for pain points, feature requests, Jobs-to-Be-Done patterns, sentiment, themes, metrics, competitors, and quotes.",
      "Provide PRD template guidance for standard PRDs, one-page PRDs, agile epics, and feature briefs.",
      "Guide discovery, prioritization, metrics, stakeholder management, and go-to-market planning with documented frameworks.",
      "Generate sample feature CSV data for trying the RICE workflow locally."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "The scripts process local files only and do not connect to Jira, Linear, Figma, analytics, or research platforms.",
      "Interview analysis uses keyword and regex rules, so it may miss context, sarcasm, or nuanced sentiment.",
      "RICE results depend on manually supplied estimates and should be reviewed against strategy and dependencies.",
      "PRD templates provide structure, but users must supply evidence, scope, designs, and acceptance criteria."
    ],
